# BlackArch Plymouth animation.
#
# The artwork is a 96-frame, 24 fps loop. The animation and progress bar are
# laid out as one centred unit and are only scaled down when the display is too
# small. Its 640x360 alpha canvas preserves all smoke and embers while keeping
# the visible emblem close to the static themes' visual scale.

